#, no-wrap
msgid "Observe effect of gate error on the model {#observe-effect-of-gate-error-on-the-model}"
msgstr "Observă efectul erorii porților asupra modelului {#observe-effect-of-gate-error-on-the-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
